  "description": "The PC lens features higher transmittance than other materials,which provides a clearer & brighter lighting so that you can enjoy a pleasant & safe drive.\nFitment\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD\n2003-2004 Chevy Silverado 2500\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 2500 HD/3500\n2007 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD/2500 HD/3500 Classic\n2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche 1500/2500 Pickup (Without Body Cladding)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: Headlights assembly compatible with 2003 2004 2005 2006 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD; 2003 2004 Chevy Silverado 2500; 2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 2500 HD/3500; 2007 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD/2500 HD/3500 Classic; 2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche 1500/2500 Pickup (Without Body Cladding); High beam bulb type: HB3/9005, Low beam bulb type:HB4/9006. Bulbs are not included\nEnhanced Visibility & Safety: LED headlights make your vehicle more conspicuous during the day, while the projector lens delivers a stronger, concentrated beam at night. You'll see better and be seen better in all driving conditions\nWaterproof Design: Fully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries in sorts of weather conditions\nImpact Resistance: Impact-resistant polycarbonate lens absorbs shocks from gravel and potholes. Reinforced housing dampens vibration for long-lasting structural integrity\nEasy to Install: No modification, no cutting, or no drilling needed. The headlight assembly looks and functions like the stock headlights; professional installation would be highly recommended",
